[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9669.19, "timestamp": "02:41:09", "text": "直播就是6點7點開始。昨天是7點。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9690.469, "timestamp": "02:41:30", "text": "所以，直播是從早上7點開始的。今天是8點。嗨。不過我不會在這裡待太久。你好。沒關係。  沒關係。沒關係。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9703.59, "timestamp": "02:41:43", "text": "[音樂] 是啊，當然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9706.95, "timestamp": "02:41:46", "text": "。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9709.75, "timestamp": "02:41:49", "text": "早上過"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9712.79, "timestamp": "02:41:52", "text": "得怎麼樣？巴卡，"}]